-08-06\n- Evidence considered: #136, #150, #177, #147 (operator routing)\n- Significant changes from prior assessment: First luna profile (was not previously documented)","created_at":"2026-08-06T00:18:00.701767742Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:9DWgR7EZs9TzI+CSf9QOKPTK/LUQzXpzxo4q7qjICJw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg5WLaN76jNQ76l0zXxQ4vppVv+tVax7SoQJE69Ljij/cAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABATjGbXVpaGUqSLeqmwXZySjb5uzoss5P+KjqFvTtXtbPhBvUEZ7QfVtnennFv6J4KRz3Olwnze3P1uAI2uSJAAg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:9DWgR7EZs9TzI+CSf9QOKPTK/LUQzXpzxo4q7qjICJw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg5WLaN76jNQ76l0zXxQ4vppVv+tVax7SoQJE69Ljij/cAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHbJvAH2n4ibBaQXBaXAWOHjWq6ecJx6G2ihmdPG3xBopv79UTz9Da/xG9Rt9rnzu+K4gT2lbs9bLBkAMRNT7QQ="}
